      "id": "xu-zhimo-poems-s0019-p00019",
      "source_en": "Moon, I spoke shyly, please register the tears of mixed hot and cold emotion, in your sorrowful ledger made for the record of tear-debts; Moon, I spoke with a choked voice, please check whether the clear, streaming tears in my life’s ledger are to be entered as new accounts, or used to clear old debts?",
